---
import ProductImage from "./ProductImage.astro";
import { agents } from "../lib/agents";

const runtimeNotes: Record<string, string> = {
  "Claude Code": "外部 Claude CLI",
  Codex: "现有 CLI / 受管运行时",
  OpenCode: "外部认证配置",
  Cursor: "本地 Agent SDK",
  Grok: "外部认证配置",
  Antigravity: "原生准备流程",
};
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
  <div class="container capability-row">
    <ProductImage family="project-board" />
    <div class="capability-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">PROJECTS, WITH STRUCTURE</p>
      <h2 id="projects-title">把分散的工作，<br />组织成清晰的项目。</h2>
      <p>用项目与 Issue 承接目标，用看板和列表理解进展。每条任务有自己的正文与状态，不必把工作上下文留在零散对话里。</p>
      <ul class="capability-points">
        <li><strong>切换视角，不切换事实</strong><span>看板、列表、表格等视图使用同一份项目数据。</span></li>
        <li><strong>任务有明确的归属</strong><span>项目范围与操作权限仍由 PM 核验。</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="text-link" href="/get-started/#scope">了解项目目标与执行目录 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section surface-soft" aria-labelledby="markdown-title">
  <div class="container capability-row capability-row-reverse">
    <div class="capability-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">CONTEXT THAT STAYS READABLE</p>
      <h2 id="markdown-title">说明和核对记录，<br />就留在任务旁。</h2>
      <p>用 Markdown 描述需求、保留上下文和核对清单。回到任务详情，就能一起查看正文、讨论与当前业务状态。</p>
      <ul class="capability-points">
        <li><strong>可阅读，也可核对</strong><span>保存后读回真实内容，不用聊天回复替代业务记录。</span></li>
        <li><strong>明确引用，再开始对话</strong><span>把所选任务带入 Chat，不自动绑定代码目录或扩大权限。</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="text-link" href="/get-started/#scope">阅读 Markdown 与目录说明 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <ProductImage family="task-readback" />
  </div>
</section>

<section id="agents" class="section provider-section" aria-labelledby="providers-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="provider-heading">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PROVIDER. YOUR CHOICE.</p>
        <h2 id="providers-title">沿用你自己的模型与账号。</h2>
        <p>在同一个工作台管理不同 Provider 的配置入口。按实际驱动连接 CLI、SDK 或受管运行时，再选择本次会话使用的模型。</p>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/get-started/#first-run">查看配置步骤 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="provider-strip" aria-label="部分 Provider 配置入口与运行方式">
      {agents.map((agent) => (
        <li>
          <span class="provider-icon"><img src={`/harnesses/${agent.icon}`} alt="" width="26" height="26" loading="lazy" /></span>
          <div><h3>{agent.name}</h3><p>{runtimeNotes[agent.name]}</p></div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <div class="provider-status">
      <span class="pill">配置入口已实现 · 实际账号需检查</span>
      <p>运行方式依据当前使用指南，不是在线探测或合作背书。本次采集未执行模型；账号、额度与平台能力仍须分别验收，AI 费用由供应商独立收取。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="deployment" class="section surface-soft" aria-labelledby="deployment-title">
  <div class="container deployment-layout">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PROJECT. YOUR ENVIRONMENT.</p>
      <h2 id="deployment-title">你的项目，<br />你的工作环境。</h2>
      <p>从自己的可信本机环境开始。选择浏览器中的自托管工作台，或先了解桌面版的运行与发行边界。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/plans/">自托管与未来云套餐有什么不同？ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="deployment-options">
      <article>
        <div class="deployment-option-heading"><h3>Web 自托管</h3><span class="pill">当前使用路径</span></div>
        <p>在你自己的环境运行项目与 Agent 工作台。全新实例完成首次设置；已有实例使用原账号登录。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/get-started/">阅读部署指南 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="deployment-option-heading"><h3>Desktop</h3><span class="pill">原生验收未闭合</span></div>
        <p>先核对本地模式、版本与验证记录。Windows／macOS 是构建目标，不等于已有可安装的正式版本。</p>
        <div class="deployment-links"><a class="text-link" href="/desktop/">桌面运行方式 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/download/">发行与下载状态 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .capability-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(0,.85fr); align-items: center; gap: 64px; }
  .capability-row-reverse { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.3fr); }
  .capability-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .capability-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .capability-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(28px,3vw,40px); }
  .capability-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .capability-points { display: grid; gap: 20px; margin-block: 28px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .capability-points li { padding-left: 18px; border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); }
  .capability-points strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .capability-points span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .provider-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 40px; }
  .provider-heading .section-head { max-width: 790px; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .provider-heading > a { flex-shrink: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .provider-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0; padding: 12px 0; margin-block: 36px 24px; list-style: none; border-block: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .provider-strip li { display: flex; align-items: center; min-width: 0; gap: 14px; padding: 18px 22px; }
  .provider-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-control); background: var(--dark); }
  .provider-icon img { width: 26px; height: 26px; object-fit: contain; }
  .provider-strip h3 { margin: 0 0 3px; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .provider-strip p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .provider-status { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 20px; }
  .provider-status .pill { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .provider-status p { max-width: 820px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .deployment-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr); align-items: start; gap: 96px; }
  .deployment-layout .section-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .deployment-layout .section-head > a { margin-top: 24px; }
  .deployment-options { display: grid; gap: 32px; }
  .deployment-options article + article { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 32px; }
  .deployment-option-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .deployment-option-heading h3 { font-size: 25px; }
  .deployment-options p { margin-block: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .deployment-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .capability-row { gap: 36px; }
    .deployment-layout { gap: 48px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .capability-row, .capability-row-reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .capability-row > .capability-copy { grid-row: 1; max-width: 700px; }
    .provider-heading { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 20px; }
    .provider-status { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .provider-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
    .provider-strip li { padding: 16px 12px; }
    .deployment-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .provider-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 28px; }
    .provider-strip li { padding: 12px 0; }
    .provider-strip li + li { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  }
</style>
